{'symbol': 'WFC', 'date': '2023-03-22 16:30:00', 'title': 'WELLS FARGO BANK INCREASES PRIME RATE TO 8.00 PERCENT', 'text': 'SAN FRANCISCO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--WELLS FARGO BANK, N.A., SAID TODAY IT IS INCREASING ITS PRIME RATE TO 8.00 PERCENT FROM 7.75 PERCENT, EFFECTIVE TOMORROW, MARCH 23, 2023. ABOUT WELLS FARGO WELLS FARGO & COMPANY (NYSE: WFC) IS A LEADING FINANCIAL SERVICES COMPANY THAT HAS APPROXIMATELY $1.9 TRILLION IN ASSETS, PROUDLY SERVES ONE IN THREE U.S. HOUSEHOLDS AND MORE THAN 10% OF SMALL BUSINESSES IN THE U.S., AND IS A LEADING MIDDLE MARKET BANKING PROVIDER IN THE U.S.'}